\[\mathbf{c} \times (\mathbf{a} \times \mathbf{a}) = \mathbf{b} \times \mathbf{a}.\]Then
\[\mathbf{c} \cdot (\mathbf{a} \times \mathbf{a}) = \mathbf{b} \cdot (\mathbf{a} \times \mathbf{a}).\]Since $\mathbf{a} \times \mathbf{a} = \mathbf{0},$ $\mathbf{c} \cdot (\mathbf{a} \times \mathbf{a}) = \mathbf{b} \cdot (\mathbf{a} \times \mathbf{a}) = 0.$

